  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting accountability through civil society in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to strengthen Ukrainian civil society&#x2019;s capacity to ensure accountability and integrity in the sectors of reconstruction, energy, and natural resources.  Its three objectives are:

1.Investigations and monitoring: Civil society is strengthened in its capacity to investigate or monitor economic actors in the identified sectors.
2.Business integrity and engagement: Civil society is strengthened in its capacity to engage with economic actors by promoting business integrity and compliance.
3.Advocacy and regulatory reform: Civil society strengthens its advocacy regarding policy, enforcement, and regulatory environments for integrity and accountability of economic actors.

The project will enhance transparency and oversight in high-risk sectors, support integrity-based engagement with business, and promote systemic reforms contributing to Ukraine&#x2019;s EU integration, economic recovery, and anti-corruption strategy implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
